slides.prompt:
A sophisticated circular process diagram that visualizes organizational momentum. A central hub containing the core mission is surrounded by five radiating arrow segments that create a clockwise sense of flow. Each segment is distinguished by a bold color from the master palette (Green, Red, Orange), ensuring each phase of the innovative cycle is distinct and memorable. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "CircularWheel",
    "center_hub": { "size": "180px", "bg": "#1E293B", "text": "MISSION" },
    "segments": 5
  },
  "colors": {
    "palette": ["#059669", "#DC2626", "#F59E0B", "#2563EB", "#7C3AED"],
    "text_on_bg": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "arrow_style": "curved-bold",
    "spacing": "8px"
  },
  "typography": {
    "label": { "size": "14px", "weight": "Bold" },
    "desc": { "size": "11px", "color": "#94A3B8" }
  }
}

A striking vertical delivery infographic that communicates structural stability and upward growth. Five distinct process streams rise from a solid foundation, expanding horizontally as they ascend to represent increasing scale. Each stream is capped with a custom icon, creating a clear visual roadmap of the delivery pipeline from research to deployment. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "VerticalPipeline",
  "base": { "height": "40px", "color": "#1E293B" },
  "streams": {
    "count": 5,
    "growth_factor": "horizontal-expansion"
  },
  "colors": {
    "gradient_start": "#059669",
    "gradient_end": "#10B981"
  },
  "icons": ["search", "pen-tool", "box", "shield-check", "send"]
}

A sophisticated two-step circular infographic designed to highlight the continuous nature of agile development. Two large, arching arrows create a never-ending bi-directional loop around a central hub of team interaction. The high-contrast color scheme emphasizes the distinct phases of collection and implementation, creating a powerful visual for iterative growth. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "DoubleArcLoop",
  "center": { "icon": "users", "color": "#1E293B" },
  "arcs": [
    { "direction": "cw", "color": "#F59E0B", "label": "COLLECT" },
    { "direction": "ccw", "color": "#DC2626", "label": "IMPLEMENT" }
  ],
  "typography": {
    "step_title": "Black 24px",
    "step_desc": "Medium 14px"
  }
}

A detailed branching tree flowchart that visualizes complex organizational hierarchies. A large root node at the top branches into four primary strategic divisions, each further subdividing into granular tasks. The design uses clean geometric lines and consistent color-coding to make even the most complex project structures easy to navigate. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "TopDownTree",
  "root": { "size": "240x80px", "bg": "#1E293B", "color": "#FFFFFF" },
  "branches": 4,
  "line_style": { "color": "#CBD5E1", "thickness": "2px" },
  "colors": {
    "branch_a": "#059669",
    "branch_b": "#DC2626",
    "branch_c": "#F59E0B",
    "branch_d": "#2563EB"
  }
}

A highly structured 2x2 grid layout that organizes high-density service information with agency-level precision. Each quadrant is an independent visual container with a large, high-contrast icon and a detailed list of deliverables. Subtle background separation and consistent padding ensure that each phase of the project is presented with absolute clarity. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "2x2BentoGrid",
  "gap": "24px",
  "card": {
    "padding": "32px",
    "border": "1px solid #E2E8F0",
    "radius": "12px"
  },
  "icons": {
    "color": "#059669",
    "size": "48px"
  },
  "typography": {
    "title": "Bold 20px #1E293B",
    "list": "Regular 13px #64748B"
  }
}

A sophisticated concentric circle diagram that illustrates the radiating impact of a core mission. Three layers of decreasing opacity surround a vibrant central hub, visually representing the transition from internal values to global market dominance. This model uses a unified color gradient to communicate cohesion across all organizational levels. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ConcentricLayers",
  "layers": 4,
  "colors": {
    "center": "#DC2626",
    "step": "opacity-decrease"
  },
  "typography": {
    "label": "Bold 12px #FFFFFF",
    "pos": "inside-arc"
  }
}

A high-energy zigzag diagram that represents the dynamic journey of project evolution. Rounded diamond markers are placed along a diagonal path, creating a sense of forward momentum and growth. Each milestone is numbered and color-coded, guiding the stakeholder through the chronological journey from opportunity to optimization. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ZigzagPath",
  "marker": { "shape": "diamond", "size": "80px" },
  "line": { "style": "dashed", "color": "#CBD5E1" },
  "colors": ["#059669", "#F59E0B", "#DC2626", "#2563EB"]
}

A high-fidelity hub-and-spoke diagram that visualizes a centralized management structure. A large central management node is connected to five specialized secondary nodes via clean geometric lines. Each node is housed in its own distinct visual container with a representative icon, communicating both organizational unity and specialized focus. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "HubAndSpoke",
  "hub": { "size": "160px", "color": "#1E293B" },
  "nodes": 5,
  "node_size": "100px",
  "typography": {
    "node_title": "Bold 12px",
    "node_desc": "Medium 10px"
  }
}

A minimalist sequential tab infographic designed for linear process clarity. Alternating rounded tabs create a clear step-by-step flow, each anchored by a large high-contrast icon and an alphabetic identifier. The design is optimized for communicating multi-stage enterprise procedures to an executive audience. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "HorizontalTabs",
  "tab_count": 4,
  "colors": {
    "active": "#059669",
    "inactive": "#F1F5F9"
  },
  "typography": {
    "tab_label": "Bold 18px",
    "tab_body": "Regular 12px"
  }
}

A high-density grid specifically architected for complex process tracking and enterprise auditing. The matrix presents project stages and sub-tasks in a rigid, easy-to-read table format, utilizing the master palette (Green, Red, Orange) for header and category differentiation. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "TechnicalMatrix",
  "rows": 4,
  "cols": 3,
  "header_bg": "#1E293B",
  "colors": {
    "alt_row": "#F8FAFC",
    "border": "#E2E8F0"
  },
  "typography": {
    "header": "Bold 12px #FFFFFF",
    "cell": "Regular 11px #475569"
  }
}
